# Manual API requests for local testing.
#
# Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client). Click the
# "Send Request" link above any request below. Start the server first with `pnpm dev`.
#
# Keep this file current as endpoints change; it doubles as a live map of the API surface.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health


### ---------- Ingredients ----------

### List all ingredients (57, each with compounds, aroma notes, and tags assembled)
GET {{base}}/ingredients

### A real botanical with a related family and a hormetic dose curve
GET {{base}}/ingredients/foxglove

### A botanical carrying the volatile trait
GET {{base}}/ingredients/valerian

### The only aberrant ingredient currently authored
GET {{base}}/ingredients/hanahaki-petals

### Not found: expect 404 with { error: { code: "NOT_FOUND", message } }
GET {{base}}/ingredients/nonexistent


### ---------- Solvents ----------

### List all solvents (5 grounded, 3 fictional)
GET {{base}}/solvents

### Grounded solvent: restricted outcome compatibility
GET {{base}}/solvents/water

### Fictional solvent: bypasses outcome gates, carries a signature transformation
GET {{base}}/solvents/lacuna

### Not found: expect 404
GET {{base}}/solvents/nonexistent


### ---------- Combinations ----------

### Resolve a grounded combination through the pipeline. Rosemary's mnemonic tag produces a
### memory_recall effect; both ingredients' warming tags produce warming_sensation.
POST {{base}}/combinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["rosemary", "ginger"],
  "solvent": "water",
  "outcome": "potion"
}

### Fictional solvent (Lacuna): effects transmute to subtractive forms; adds an absence mark
### and a narrative wrap. (sensoryOutput, name, and lore are null pending Phases 9 and 10.)
POST {{base}}/combinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["rosemary", "ginger"],
  "solvent": "lacuna",
  "outcome": "potion"
}

### Validation failure: too few ingredients (minimum 2). Expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR.
POST {{base}}/combinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["foxglove"],
  "solvent": "water",
  "outcome": "potion"
}

### Validation failure: too many ingredients (maximum 4). Expect 400.
POST {{base}}/combinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["foxglove", "valerian", "belladonna", "chamomile", "yarrow"],
  "solvent": "water",
  "outcome": "potion"
}

### Validation failure: outcome not in the enum. Expect 400.
POST {{base}}/combinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["foxglove", "valerian"],
  "solvent": "water",
  "outcome": "nonsense"
}

### Validation failure: missing required field (solvent). Expect 400.
POST {{base}}/combinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ingredients": ["foxglove", "valerian"],
  "outcome": "potion"
}
